# Default target of the `env_file` indirection in worker-compose.yaml.
#
# It is intentionally empty: compose treats an absent III_<WORKER>_UI_WATCH
# exactly like `0`, so a plain `iii compose --up` reads this file and changes
# nothing. workers-dev points WORKERS_DEV_ENV_FILE at harness/.env.workers-dev
# (gitignored) instead and writes the real flags there.
#
# KEEP THIS FILE. compose validates every declared env_file when it first loads
# the project, so deleting it fails every compose call against this project —
# compose::status included — before a single container starts.
